  "visualReview": {
    "coverage": "Viewed every page and cover in eight 3×3 contact sheets, then re-viewed every corrected sheet. Full-size final checks: 0129 p08, 0130 p07, 0133 p08, 0135 p06.",
    "notes": [
      "0129: five-finger yellow glove retains a blue wrist tie; long ribbon has a visible join before one section is detached; high snow seat is lowered and widened, then a low armrest aligns with the thumb; finale has blue flag and retained waist tie.",
      "0130: fixed six-window strip with consistent cloud, field, river, mountain, tree and grandmother-with-peach sequence; removed seventh window from tucked scene; rolled state exposes only grandmother; folds lie between windows and final accordion displays all six.",
      "0131: red flask moves from shoulder to floor; front seed passengers have seats and closed plumes; rear umbrella stays open beside wind-blown blue ribbon until half-window closes; ribbon then hangs and umbrella remains bundled; bell/closed door and inverted train reflections precede lotus arrival.",
      "0132: blanket remains yellow with orange corner edging; whole-roll attempt has no body, while later only one corner forms trunk and remaining fabric makes body/ears; fox arms support it; final blanket covers legs with one curled corner and no lower-edge clipping.",
      "0133: yellow bag and reusable ticket persist; cloud vehicle has cap, round windows and door; pig/duck leave at candy street before mouse chooses lake on the next ride; lake finale has only mouse on wide dock and one moving water drop remaining on lily leaf; clipped seated-tail remnant removed.",
      "0134: round stone retains three white forehead spots, yellow overalls and green bag; empty strawberry basket precedes pear slices; forced smile, closed eyes and tear precede willing bite; two plates empty at ending and trouser water spot fades; beaver stands behind counter.",
      "0135: full can stays on ground during failed lift/push, spill is wiped, two clean pails each hold half-water when empty can moves to its stand; cup returns water, final buckets are empty; rim cup is supported and cover spout is within frame; can has no walking limbs.",
      "0136: exactly one yellow cloth ball is held in page two and otherwise returns to basket; bubble has no arms or feet and drifts away from toy car; first gate is red, then blue/yellow added; openings fit bubble, yellow gate receives golden bubble in final sunlight."
    ],
    "limits": "Simplified vector picture-book style. Contact sheets inspect composition and continuity; selected pages enlarged. No claim of bitmap painting, audio QA, browser layout QA or child-user testing."
